            "detailed_description": "Demon Grade is a VR FPS featuring free 360 degree movement, with no jogging in place, no teleporting, and no rails.  In Demon Grade, you will explore dynamically generated levels in first person perspective while fighting relentless demonic enemies and collecting their demon shards to unlock various weapons.  Move, Shoot, and Survive in Demon Grade VR... if you can.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDynamically generated Levels<br />\r\n4 Weapons to unlock ( 5 in total )<br />\r\nNew nausea-free locomotion<br />\r\nFree 360 Movement with just the tilt of your head<br />\r\nMOVE, SHOOT, SURVIVE today!",
